  "text": {
    "en": {
      "name": "Amazoness Swordmaster",
      "effect": "2 \"Amazoness\" monsters\nWhen your \"Amazoness\" monster destroys an opponent's monster by battle: You can draw 1 card. You can only use each of the following effects of \"Amazoness Swordmaster\" once per turn. If this card is Fusion Summoned: You can Special Summon 1 Level 4 or lower \"Amazoness\" monster from your Deck. (Quick Effect): You can Tribute 1 monster, then target 1 Effect Monster on the field; it loses 500 ATK, also negate its effects.",
      "official": false
    },
